        "message": "LU-18687 fid: handle CONFIG_LUSTRE_FS_SERVER tristate\n\nConvert fid to tristate CONFIG_LUSTRE_FS_SERVER\n\n#include <lu_target.h> is added for build \"=m\"\n(in tree) because those files compile today\nbecause obd_class.h includes lu_target.h,\nobd_target.h and dt_object.h under\n#ifdef CONFIG_LUSTRE_FS_SERVER. That guard is\nfalse for an in-tree =m build, and this include\nworks around it\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\nChange-Id: Ia362acb03ed3f8b0cf5b53aee9dc4c052f1cb951\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/70328\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\n"
